account.terms.n1refunds2awithdrawalwithin14daysrefundseveryth = { $slot-1 }Refunds.{ $slot-2 } A withdrawal within 14 days refunds everything you paid for that subscription, or for that renewal (above). Apart from those, a cancel in a renewed year and one for a serious reason (above), we don't run refund math on a cancellation, because you keep the service through the end of what you paid for. If you're charged in error, whether a duplicate charge, a charge after you canceled, or a billing mistake, email { $slot-3 } or use the billing portal (a page { $slot-4 } hosts for us, linked from your services) and { $slot-5 }we'll refund the incorrect amount{ $slot-6 }. Nothing here affects any chargeback or refund right you have through your card issuer or under the law where you live.
